{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3025021010010","name":"甜花","text":"（お腹、空いた……）","trans":"（肚子，饿了……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010020","name":"甜花","text":"（あった……クリームパン……）","trans":"（找到了……奶油面包……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010030","name":"雛菜","text":"は～\r\nお腹減った～","trans":"哈——\n肚子饿了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010050","name":"雛菜","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010070","name":"甜花","text":"お、お疲れ様……","trans":"辛、辛苦了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010080","name":"甜花","text":"（どうしよ……\r\nこれ、甜花の……けど……）","trans":"（怎么办……\n这个，是甜花的……可是……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010090","name":"甜花","text":"……クリームパン……\r\nいる……？","trans":"……奶油面包……\n要吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010100","name":"雛菜","text":"へ～\r\nいいんですか～？","trans":"诶——\n可以吗——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010110","name":"甜花","text":"うん……４つ、ある……から……\r\nひとつ……どうぞ……","trans":"嗯……有4个……所以……\n一个……给你……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010120","name":"雛菜","text":"じゃあ……\r\nいただきます～","trans":"那……\n我就不客气了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010130","name":"愛依","text":"あ～……\r\nお腹減った～……","trans":"啊——……\n肚子饿了啊——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010150","name":"甜花","text":"あ……えと……\r\n……これ……ひとつ、どうぞ……","trans":"啊……那个……\n……这个……给你一个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010160","name":"愛依","text":"マジ！？　サンキュー！\r\nいただきま～す♪","trans":"真的！？　谢啦！\n我开动了～♪","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010190","name":"甜花","text":"……お、お疲れ様……\r\nです……","trans":"……辛、辛苦了……\n……那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010200","name":"甜花","text":"……緋田さんも……\r\nお腹、空いてる……？","trans":"……绯田也……\n肚子，饿了吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010210","name":"美琴","text":"私は大丈夫","trans":"我不用了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010220","name":"甜花","text":"やた……！\r\nじゃ、なくて……ほんとに……？","trans":"太好了……！\n不，不是……真的吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010230","name":"美琴","text":"……それ、４つ入りでしょ？","trans":"……那个，是4个装的吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010240","name":"美琴","text":"４つ食べようと思って買ったんじゃないの？","trans":"你不是打算吃4个才买的吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010260","name":"美琴","text":"大丈夫、お腹は空いていないから","trans":"没事，我不饿","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010270","name":"美琴","text":"私の分も食べて","trans":"把我那份也吃了吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010280","name":"甜花","text":"わかった……\r\nじゃあ、甜花も……いただきます……────","trans":"知道了……\n那，甜花也……开动了……————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010290","name":"愛依","text":"あ～、美味しかった～！\r\n甜花ちゃんへ～！　ちょー感謝！","trans":"啊——，好好吃——！\n甜花——！　超级感谢！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010300","name":"雛菜","text":"ごちそうさまです～","trans":"多谢款待——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010320","name":"愛依","text":"ね、写真とかどう！？","trans":"对了，拍张照片怎么样！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010340","name":"愛依","text":"じゃ、みんなで～！","trans":"那，大家一起——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010360","name":"雛菜","text":"あは～いいですよ～","trans":"啊哈——可以哦——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010370","name":"愛依","text":"ほらほら、美琴さんも～！","trans":"来来，美琴也——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010400","name":"美琴","text":"うん、撮ろうか","trans":"嗯，拍吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010410","name":"愛依","text":"アハハ、いいね～！","trans":"啊哈哈，不错呢——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3025021010420","name":"甜花","text":"（みんな笑顔……\r\n甜花の、おかげ……？）","trans":"（大家都笑着……\n是托了甜花的福……？）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}